{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Placeground, a relaxing home builder where the way you design a space shapes the stories that unfold inside it. Build freely, decorate to your heart\u2019s content, and watch as characters interact with your created space - playing out small moments, surprises, and stories right before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/1c802ae39a3fc779e680455580072751.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/1c802ae39a3fc779e680455580072751.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/1c802ae39a3fc779e680455580072751.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals, no pressure, and no wrong choices to make. Just you, a blank room, and the joy of watching life play out in the rooms you design. Every object you place nudges the direction of your characters' stories, making every room feel like a tiny stage for everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, decorate, relax, and let stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/d03d9451d4b1f9d35f6bb78abb5b55ff.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/d03d9451d4b1f9d35f6bb78abb5b55ff.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/d03d9451d4b1f9d35f6bb78abb5b55ff.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom interiors and terraces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your space with flexible wall and layout tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate freely with over 100 functional and decorative objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize everything \u2013 adjust color, size, rotation, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint and apply your own textures to personalize every detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs respond to your designs in meaningful, story-driven ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new items, modules, and systems through NPC interaction and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abstract stories through NPC behaviors and environmental clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Photo Mode to capture your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between rendering styles to change the visual tone<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854340?t=1772552459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854340?t=1772552459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/817edfb401305baea91fe401f5574b5c495a74ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772552459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/817edfb401305baea91fe401f5574b5c495a74ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772552459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/6600f2cc6cc1bb4b09fb16b5aaf63b96.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Placeground, a relaxing home builder where the way you design a space shapes the stories that 