l class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom interiors and terraces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your space with flexible wall and layout tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate freely with over 100 functional and decorative objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize everything \u2013 adjust color, size, rotation, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint and apply your own textures to personalize every detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs respond to your designs in meaningful, story-driven ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new items, modules, and systems through NPC interaction and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abstract stories through NPC behaviors and environmental clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Photo Mode to capture your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between rendering styles to change the visual tone<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.poster.avif?t=1772552459\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.webm?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/extras/95fae25632362fc22d5c9364862058f8.mp4?t=1772552459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["beyondthosehills"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854340/9c05ec663b6224eb7e6c539ca0337a19e25d39fc/header.jpg?t=1772552459","is_free":false,"linux_require